%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 1692b84ec15ee4995bf4450fa009f73d, type: 3}
  m_Name: rcp-asistente-emergencia-demo
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: XRLabs.Core::XRLabs.Core.LineLibrary
  speakerName: Coach
  speakerPortrait: {fileID: 0}
  lines:
  - id: p0.amarre
    note: claro, firme y pausado
    textOnly: 0
    variants:
    - language: 0
      text: "Antes de empezar, recuerda amarrar y sujetar firmemente al paciente
        y a ti mismo al piso o a las sujeciones del m\xF3dulo espacial para que no
        floten durante las compresiones."
      spokenText: 
      clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 90d2a28a7dace49a7b70d55d87269b70, type: 3}
      bakeHash: ed7fcaf551e8a5911c6b86b8d81ab240294665e385ff39788d663f8b45d570ac
    - language: 1
      text: Before you begin, remember to strap and anchor both the patient and yourself
        firmly to the floor or spacecraft restraints so neither of you floats away
        during compressions.
      spokenText: 
      clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 1902822ff75e44dbb8479936095c42a5, type: 3}
      bakeHash: d83701e94792f5bfc3605f12b7daf29ba91ac600bcd74b87bc3e2d8e3e84e849
  - id: p1.bienvenida
    note: firme, calmado y directo; frases cortas
    textOnly: 0
    variants:
    - language: 0
      text: "Mant\xE9n la calma. Te voy a guiar paso a paso."
      spokenText: 
      clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: eb0842c4fee7a4ba8a9aaaf59184d1cd, type: 3}
      bakeHash: 2ee89a236d2bc0bb133c2cd8f6cdd9cc18110da784cfad5d1c3f237725a2c444
    - language: 1
      text: Stay calm. I will guide you step by step.
      spokenText: 
      clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 13f5a32bc88b6464c809d5e5fdeaddaf, type: 3}
      bakeHash: e45c575c0c645d14b9885faa19fe3a4d031d12de2f5b9e1b9ad9b1f069ca8fec
  - id: p1.seguridad
    note: 
    textOnly: 0
    variants:
    - language: 0
      text: Comprueba que el lugar es seguro para ti y para la persona.
      spokenText: 
      clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: f974ce6cc176b4121940cd7edba21707, type: 3}
      bakeHash: 3408897b7f5f50eb80396e5467c554b2190e58f882ce94f53004658766fcc202
    - language: 1
      text: Make sure the area is safe for you and for the person.
      spokenText: 
      clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: c07551c0571b849c890c14fef7a10aa0, type: 3}
      bakeHash: 9ea9ed6ace03b25466bbc4e5c0d15af3a075e5e78ba2d929b0777220ef131257
  - id: p2.instr
    note: 
    textOnly: 0
    variants:
    - language: 0
      text: "Sacude con suavidad sus hombros y pregunta en voz alta: \xBFme oyes?
        Toca la marca de los hombros cuando lo hayas hecho."
      spokenText: 
      clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 6082fb187200b4a13aba86050e9d9521, type: 3}
      bakeHash: a9094a08dc6017cf844388a83dfe3f822ef80217b036c620a7bf87f51cf185c4
    - language: 1
      text: 'Gently shake their shoulders and ask out loud: can you hear me? Touch
        the shoulder marker when you have done it.'
      spokenText: 
      clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 298fa7dbe79b741c5898f4dc802a4c89, type: 3}
      bakeHash: cd16b20a472125d101dd34f2144622ead8ce9715e0a834ec393690dbc97de74e
  - id: p2.pista
    note: 
    textOnly: 0
    variants:
    - language: 0
      text: "Habla fuerte, cerca de su o\xEDdo. Luego toca la marca sobre sus hombros."
      spokenText: 
      clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 4a32d7d0141644d5c90f602213c9b904, type: 3}
      bakeHash: f6413f2f2b6b5532987822788b91b62f51d7f8fe66577dbd1af03c5a90d67cf4
    - language: 1
      text: Speak loudly, close to their ear. Then touch the marker on their shoulders.
      spokenText: 
      clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: d6593b72a957e40d68b17f6bf2f2a001, type: 3}
      bakeHash: a4b597c17d0a428f0d527f234dc3d5aabb907c6bda08dc80a2de496ef2c3cd08
  - id: p2.exito
    note: 
    textOnly: 0
    variants:
    - language: 0
      text: Si no responde, pide ayuda en voz alta. Ahora comprobamos si respira.
      spokenText: 
      clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 2655cc6ffc36c40908d8ad1bb914aebf, type: 3}
      bakeHash: a46e08376ab8a85bd498625acbbf7636374bbdfaf2770d804338cd3052260e8b
    - language: 1
      text: If there is no response, call out for help. Now we check if they are
        breathing.
      spokenText: 
      clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: face09836431e488f94dd9191c878feb, type: 3}
      bakeHash: b82cb20dfe16bed1b3aacb5a151dcdb88ae0244746a83e8055d3779f02349e7e
  - id: p3.instr
    note: 
    textOnly: 0
    variants:
    - language: 0
      text: "Mira su pecho durante no m\xE1s de diez segundos. \xBFRespira con normalidad?
        Pulsa 1 si respira con normalidad, o 2 si no respira o solo jadea."
      spokenText: "Mira su pecho durante no m\xE1s de diez segundos. \xBFRespira
        con normalidad? Pulsa uno si respira con normalidad, o dos si no respira
        o solo jadea."
      clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 8750c2a7d0b854f10b4a069a1166d116, type: 3}
      bakeHash: ac1b191ec62efbe888c0bab89aa205df5baaf7ce9f6efbc239bb268c3b5fbe4f
    - language: 1
      text: Watch their chest for no more than ten seconds. Are they breathing normally?
        Press 1 if breathing normally, or 2 if not breathing or only gasping.
      spokenText: 
      clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 15c09cf6fed81490e96f3c87fb808117, type: 3}
      bakeHash: 542dcb93ed4352d41c1653916bd85f3ce3dd7bd5cedfbd7f7eee0083bce802b6
  - id: p3.pista
    note: 
    textOnly: 0
    variants:
    - language: 0
      text: "Los jadeos o boqueos no son una respiraci\xF3n normal. Si dudas, act\xFAa
        como si no respirara."
      spokenText: 
      clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: dd32e3feb6b0b4cfdacfc8a2c789a615, type: 3}
      bakeHash: 9db32cabce9a3466b499d79fe3fbcf32e03cac9d8b0535869105b62b1b6a31fc
    - language: 1
      text: Gasping is not normal breathing. If you are unsure, act as if they are
        not breathing.
      spokenText: 
      clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: f8289e2c76f584aa2b10588b1e2fc270, type: 3}
      bakeHash: 46e06340ef91c78126cd7afca6af0e60f383738db179402ab98393b503fd27a7
  - id: p3.exito
    note: 
    textOnly: 0
    variants:
    - language: 0
      text: "Sin respiraci\xF3n normal, hay que actuar ya con compresiones."
      spokenText: 
      clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 863672f6d4c3f4fcf94b7ab07d4abd3a, type: 3}
      bakeHash: 45613aef9029639b019c6e060134547661ab19ed1605ad8cd9cdf04666d500de
    - language: 1
      text: Without normal breathing, act now with chest compressions.
      spokenText: 
      clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: ba14bdd2a7f274f79a88c3a29bad800a, type: 3}
      bakeHash: a16f0f1275610b990d50d39622a91b89f568159d32267f30da84492153ce9000
  - id: p3.err.respira
    note: 
    textOnly: 0
    variants:
    - language: 0
      text: "Si respira con normalidad, no comprimas. Col\xF3cala de lado, vigila
        su respiraci\xF3n y llama a emergencias. Si deja de respirar con normalidad,
        vuelve a comprobar."
      spokenText: 
      clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: fdfe695f74fb34a2aacd99a8a7491e98, type: 3}
      bakeHash: a22256303e7eef16c8f8ce5d91bd7c4004ac7fbcec883321b62c083f1a2ca369
    - language: 1
      text: If they are breathing normally, do not compress. Place them on their
        side, watch their breathing and call emergency services. If they stop breathing
        normally, check again.
      spokenText: 
      clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 54463f74b52e248c6b1536a1dce11a30, type: 3}
      bakeHash: f2554e1bc2828d9e156751c0320ccf2c5b373bfa07d2841e24cd0835c20c5561
  - id: p4.instr
    note: 
    textOnly: 0
    variants:
    - language: 0
      text: "Llama ahora al n\xFAmero local de emergencias y pon el tel\xE9fono en
        altavoz. Si hay alguien cerca, p\xEDdele que llame y que traiga un desfibrilador.
        Toca Hecho cuando la llamada est\xE9 en marcha."
      spokenText: 
      clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 7e3b9ec6d00ab425fbff5d747d78a87b, type: 3}
      bakeHash: 4b5caddfb5d620a2b46bc4fd7a6a9a13e762cf8d22a535991a06d11a6350e123
    - language: 1
      text: Call your local emergency number now and put the phone on speaker. If
        someone is nearby, ask them to call and bring a defibrillator. Touch Done
        when the call is under way.
      spokenText: 
      clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 13eb5c245f0bb4cde9e455c855b0cdbc, type: 3}
      bakeHash: 17cac42a034dbcb5bb477c555ef598dca717eb7de8a657cf142d88893e446774
  - id: p4.pista
    note: 
    textOnly: 0
    variants:
    - language: 0
      text: "No cuelgues: el operador tambi\xE9n puede guiarte. Cuando la llamada
        est\xE9 en marcha, toca Hecho."
      spokenText: 
      clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 73d3d1450daa14e71bdd209d8858edac, type: 3}
      bakeHash: 0e7d9834ea126e615d31b6c5c9f383b2fc02e33a70970e1302efabbb6642996d
    - language: 1
      text: 'Do not hang up: the operator can also guide you. When the call is under
        way, touch Done.'
      spokenText: 
      clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: a3157d03cc9d346d2ac92e6c97d80eae, type: 3}
      bakeHash: 74e9830fc04ed0ea2afc1e209ce04c42afb16aeb4ebdb4f82b09338815fd53e9
  - id: p4.exito
    note: 
    textOnly: 0
    variants:
    - language: 0
      text: Bien. Sigue las indicaciones del operador. Empezamos las compresiones.
      spokenText: 
      clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 799bb0c51da874075b6bf6d85f95a008, type: 3}
      bakeHash: 4da41fa23462dda2fb4801f722eff2052c7b36e6e7a67d7496095e16d28f46c7
    - language: 1
      text: Good. Follow the operator's instructions. Let's start compressions.
      spokenText: 
      clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 76d84fe2ec6b04457a55f4f931905304, type: 3}
      bakeHash: 85b997c1150d078d56542d42168dc905e3182d7258e9dfdbf929020f98c46a4c
  - id: p5.instr
    note: 
    textOnly: 0
    variants:
    - language: 0
      text: "Col\xF3cala boca arriba. Si est\xE1 en una superficie blanda, no pierdas
        tiempo movi\xE9ndola. Arrod\xEDllate a su lado y toca el centro de su pecho
        para fijar el punto."
      spokenText: 
      clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 0b3bf39f0a892413bbf25fe0db60931f, type: 3}
      bakeHash: 0b0df428528c3074d4506ffba2bb54ebeab9e6dfcc9e3162f8d1bcae5deb241a
    - language: 1
      text: Place them on their back. If they are on a soft surface, do not waste
        time moving them. Kneel beside them and touch the center of their chest to
        set the point.
      spokenText: 
      clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: db5665483b4aa462aa7bc88a15d7a8dc, type: 3}
      bakeHash: ab62617c395848a4098d527172eb8b9ecca8276e10d995f63d884b6a57191524
  - id: p5.pista
    note: 
    textOnly: 0
    variants:
    - language: 0
      text: "El punto est\xE1 en el centro del pecho, sobre la mitad inferior del
        estern\xF3n. Toca la marca para fijarlo."
      spokenText: 
      clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: cbdc215f816e6416ab830ad3fdd374b9, type: 3}
      bakeHash: 1ecaedb0101d50d53d9f9737b46672924651c68faa62d94b66ebb3d0ec9489f2
    - language: 1
      text: The point is at the center of the chest, on the lower half of the breastbone.
        Touch the marker to set it.
      spokenText: 
      clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 30191610ffd22478fb5d47466138634d, type: 3}
      bakeHash: 62ddd8e8acb1c5ac9713fa967d0cd8bd683fdd1ec6aaaa567d3e2751802b3260
  - id: p5.exito
    note: 
    textOnly: 0
    variants:
    - language: 0
      text: Punto fijado. A comprimir.
      spokenText: 
      clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: b24f4307d8b514449999d67f7f0038bb, type: 3}
      bakeHash: 8fa71489a8212254a75569ebcd37816aa9fad8dd6e4a23ccf9baaa2ca382836c
    - language: 1
      text: Point set. Start compressions.
      spokenText: 
      clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 2b13d8682bf954d34a2b04d3f602ec0a, type: 3}
      bakeHash: 3117861ec4ebfff1299fda95742f535e1a71cddc3d2109e50c53d9154eab40cb
  - id: p9.cierre
    note: 
    textOnly: 0
    variants:
    - language: 0
      text: "Lo est\xE1s haciendo bien. No pares. Cuando llegue la ayuda, cu\xE9ntales
        a qu\xE9 hora empezaste y qu\xE9 hiciste."
      spokenText: 
      clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 0d660c7710a3a484fa599e52b5d6fbe1, type: 3}
      bakeHash: 3122b56b782b6d490c6d399d3d65ef2bac043862233dd4deb6c26e4be636c8ef
    - language: 1
      text: You are doing well. Do not stop. When help arrives, tell them when you
        started and what you did.
      spokenText: 
      clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 54425ad32b5c844b3bd4a97c41ba0b9d, type: 3}
      bakeHash: 164b2e2307481f2dbfaba4449bf8cfcac274d3f2fc77d9888c36cb69f3d3f733
  - id: ui.tarea.respuesta
    note: 
    textOnly: 1
    variants:
    - language: 0
      text: Comprobar si responde
      spokenText: 
      clip: {fileID: 0}
      bakeHash: 
    - language: 1
      text: Check responsiveness
      spokenText: 
      clip: {fileID: 0}
      bakeHash: 
  - id: ui.tarea.respiracion
    note: 
    textOnly: 1
    variants:
    - language: 0
      text: "Comprobar la respiraci\xF3n"
      spokenText: 
      clip: {fileID: 0}
      bakeHash: 
    - language: 1
      text: Check breathing
      spokenText: 
      clip: {fileID: 0}
      bakeHash: 
  - id: ui.tarea.llamar
    note: 
    textOnly: 1
    variants:
    - language: 0
      text: Llamar a emergencias
      spokenText: 
      clip: {fileID: 0}
      bakeHash: 
    - language: 1
      text: Call emergency services
      spokenText: 
      clip: {fileID: 0}
      bakeHash: 
  - id: ui.tarea.punto
    note: 
    textOnly: 1
    variants:
    - language: 0
      text: "Fijar el punto de compresi\xF3n"
      spokenText: 
      clip: {fileID: 0}
      bakeHash: 
    - language: 1
      text: Set the compression point
      spokenText: 
      clip: {fileID: 0}
      bakeHash: 
  - id: p6.instr
    note: 
    textOnly: 0
    variants:
    - language: 0
      text: "Pon el tal\xF3n de una mano en ese punto y la otra mano encima, con
        los brazos rectos. Empuja fuerte y r\xE1pido, al ritmo del sonido, al menos
        cinco cent\xEDmetros pero sin pasar de seis, y deja que el pecho suba del
        todo. No pares."
      spokenText: 
      clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 74d0487f1d7564edd9c8346e6a937fb3, type: 3}
      bakeHash: dd6ac78e2140a44a100271468148e2dcad7d27390480c13b82eac1e2f242bd47
    - language: 1
      text: Place the heel of one hand on that point and the other hand on top, with
        your arms straight. Push hard and fast, to the beat of the sound, at least
        five centimeters but no more than six, and let the chest rise fully. Do not
        stop.
      spokenText: 
      clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 8d9ae9b00de6f42188c1cdbb24fd538f, type: 3}
      bakeHash: 2698c3035e2ae680222fe7689a196f12d5f3ab6de790d487340fba86a3f49a93
  - id: p7.instr
    note: 
    textOnly: 0
    variants:
    - language: 0
      text: "Si llega un desfibrilador, que otra persona lo encienda y ponga los
        parches mientras sigues comprimiendo. Cuando analice, nadie debe tocar a
        la persona. Si indica descarga, avisa: \xA1al\xE9jense! y reanuda las compresiones
        de inmediato. Si no hay desfibrilador, sigue comprimiendo."
      spokenText: 
      clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 8dfed8af127c5481ba0f66adbca2508c, type: 3}
      bakeHash: 57a965711d4427fc98b9b2f0adbb674a0ed76d51a136b1ee941474511de93b98
    - language: 1
      text: 'If a defibrillator arrives, have someone else turn it on and place the
        pads while you keep compressing. While it analyzes, no one should touch the
        person. If it advises a shock, call out: clear! and resume compressions immediately.
        If there is no defibrillator, keep compressing.'
      spokenText: 
      clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 37e7595253a7b408f93253945fa6ddb1, type: 3}
      bakeHash: 55214908729dadc36ec371e9ea151fd2a8016c7a33a5134ce605e8034983198d
  - id: p8.instr
    note: 
    textOnly: 0
    variants:
    - language: 0
      text: "Sigue sin parar. Si hay otra persona, c\xE1mbiense cada dos minutos,
        con el menor tiempo posible sin comprimir. Contin\xFAa hasta que llegue la
        ayuda, el desfibrilador indique parar, o la persona se mueva y respire con
        normalidad."
      spokenText: 
      clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: fe41d02e2a8aa4cf1ba5fbbc887e38ac, type: 3}
      bakeHash: d80ce80ebb5e3bba19b5e4f269eb680eacaa42dccec3ea23f3bda92bd4de3363
    - language: 1
      text: Keep going without stopping. If someone else is there, switch every two
        minutes, with as little time off the chest as possible. Continue until help
        arrives, the defibrillator tells you to stop, or the person moves and breathes
        normally.
      spokenText: 
      clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: eb69d55ac89134dfea0034dcfb9a3745, type: 3}
      bakeHash: 9ed674473f93ed0c624787d89a1514383986b6af26f0addc4b732b4c2f9c41cb
  pronunciation: []
